</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/4640e6c0-6448-11f1-85b6-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/21022-37-xgaplus.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/4640e6c0-6448-11f1-85b6-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/21022-37-xgaplus.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">5d604e40-9233-11f1-af0c-ada1b72c7d88</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 10:59:42 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>夏榕</dc:creator></item><item><category>亚洲</category><title>中俄缺席广岛原爆和平纪念仪式 俄罗斯对其进行批判</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%B2/20260807-%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E7%BC%BA%E5%B8%AD%E5%B9%BF%E5%B2%9B%E5%8E%9F%E7%88%86%E5%92%8C%E5%B9%B3%E7%BA%AA%E5%BF%B5%E4%BB%AA%E5%BC%8F-%E4%BF%84%E7%BD%97%E6%96%AF%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%89%B9%E5%88%A4</link><description>
